message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Bengaluru Kere Atlas"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An interactive atlas of water quality in Bengaluru's lakes, built from the monthly
  reports of the Karnataka State Pollution Control Board (KSPCB). It provides lake
  profiles, a Lake Pressure Index, seasonal comparison, satellite comparison and a
  citywide table of flagged data errors.
